    "1.16.3-1.2.3": "Change required botania version  and fix a bug",
    "1.16.3-1.2.4": "Fixes #22",
    "1.16.3-1.2.5": "Fix the raindeletia not generating mana when it's raining and on vivid grass.",
    "1.16.3-1.2.7": "Fixes #26",
    "1.16.3-1.2.8": "Fixes #27",
    "1.16.3-1.2.9": "The aquapanthus can now fill barrels and crucibles from ex nihilo sequentia and ex compressum",
    "1.16.3-1.2.10": "Make it clear in the lexica botania that the mana scaled down and change the recipe pages to fit the mana infusion pages used by botania better.",
    "1.16.3-1.2.11": "Make it work with the most recent versions of LibX",
    "1.16.3-1.2.12": "Aded chinese translation (DevilJueChen & wisdommen)",
    "1.16.4-1.3.1": "Added alfheim dimension, mjoellnir andoother features from norse mythology.",
    "1.16.4-1.3.2": "Added a config file",
    "1.16.4-1.3.3": "Bugfixes and new Advancements",
    "1.16.4-1.3.5": "Internal changes",
    "1.16.4-1.3.7": "Hopefully fix broken alfheim",
    "1.16.4-1.3.8": "Bugfixes",
    "1.16.4-1.3.10": "Bugfixes",
    "1.16.4-1.3.12": "More config options for mjoellnir",
    "1.16.4-1.3.14": "Small changes in the lexicon and the JEI category for the mana infuser to make the mana costs more intuitive.",
    "1.16.4-1.3.15": "When the mana infuser or a rune ritual gets interrupted, it will drop solidified mana which can be converted back to mana in a mana pool.\n \nNether stars used by wither aconites, Items used by the alfsteel pylon that are not yet fully repaired and items used by the mana infuser are now protected from magnet rings\n \nDatapacks can now add rune ritual recipes that consume runes from the normal rune holders\n \nFixed a bug with JEI displaying negative relative rune positions wrongy.\n \nAlfsteel pylons now only require two alfsteel nuggets\n \nRune holders can no longer float in the air but need a solid surface below.\n \n \n ",
    "1.16.4-1.3.18": "Bugfixes",
    "1.16.4-1.3.19": "Bugfixes and made it possible to hold mjöllnir indefinitely when a ring of thor is equipped. Also changed a rune ritual recipe a little bit.\n "
  },
